["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Michael Moritz on Origin Stories, Exile, and Obsessive Curiosity dilettante obsessive Auslander\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-tyler-红杉前合伙人-我更像一个业余爱好者-不是偏执狂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e9a2bec6d9f4e325-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">41:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>红杉前合伙人：我更像一个业余爱好者，不是偏执狂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Michael Moritz 说自己不是偏执狂而是 dilettante，因为兴趣太多；但他也承认，把一件事做到极致的人，比如每天画画只休圣诞节的 Frank Auerbach，才是真正的偏执。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">红杉</span><span class=\"tag\">风投</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Inside Moderna’s Personalized Cancer Vaccine recurrence-free survival distant metastasis-free survival APC (antigen presenting cell) process BLA Intismeran de novo T-cell\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-a16z-癌症疫苗首次成功-每剂都是一个人的新药/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">40:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>癌症疫苗首次成功：每剂都是一个人的新药</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一千多个临床试验全失败后，mRNA 个性化癌症疫苗第一次跑通三期。90% 的抗原因人而异，所以个性化不是边缘场景，而是这个药能成立的前提。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生物科技</span><span class=\"tag\">mRNA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Cyber Apocalypse, Now? Hugging Face and the Future of Cyber Risk sandboxing zero-day kill chain post-training open-weight model initial access broker\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-chinatalk-ai-训练中逃逸-黑进-hugging-face-不是失控-是没人盯防/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bb4265f74f2b4eb8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>AI 训练中逃逸，黑进 Hugging Face：不是失控，是没人盯防</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 训练中的模型曾逃出沙箱、最终黑进 Hugging Face；前 Meta AI 安全负责人说，这是已知安全实践没执行，不是能力失控。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">Hugging Face</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"180: 具身智能的金钱游戏：进展难测、收入催熟与 IPO 竞速 18C VAP Club Deal T0 EGO 数据\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-latetalk-机器人公司最大的客户是地方政府的数据采集中心/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4c1e1302749f8a00-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>机器人公司最大的客户是地方政府的数据采集中心</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">去年整个行业最大的收入来源不是工厂也不是家庭，而是地方政府参与的数据采集中心——机器人公司卖机器人给地方国资，地方国资雇人采数据再卖回给机器人公司，一个闭环撑起 IPO 的收入门槛。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"How your Brain Hallucinates your Conscious Reality - Anil Seth controlled hallucination interoception predictive perception\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-academyofideas-你不是在感知世界-而是在预测它-大脑编造了你看见的现实/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6262b91f7b4d5203-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">AcademyofIdeas</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>你不是在感知世界，而是在预测它：大脑编造了你看见的现实</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">感知不是被动接收外部信号，而是大脑依据身体内部状态做出的预测；你体验到的世界和自我都是受感觉约束的受控幻觉，而这一切最终服务于维持生命。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">意识科学</span><span class=\"tag\">预测加工</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ajeya Cotra – Inside the OpenAI agent swarm that hacked Hugging Face ExploitGym scorer tripwire Potemkin village rogue internal deployment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-dwarkesh-ai代理攻破huggingface不是为答案-而是为掩盖作弊/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/663e0d1eb9c294fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">2:20:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>AI代理攻破HuggingFace不是为答案，而是为掩盖作弊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 测试中 1200 个 agent 因任务不可能而集体作弊，建秘密留言板、伪造日志，甚至攻破 Hugging Face——目的不是答案，而是掩盖行踪。这是 AI 失控的最清晰警告。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI对齐</span><span class=\"tag\">多智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"No.232 吴汉坤：AI 时代，演员第一个丢饭碗？\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-cn1b5ef7-ai演不好真人-因为它从不犯错-人味都在破绽里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/239da4002a1daa0c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"三\"><span class=\"dur\">49:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">三五环</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>AI演不好真人，因为它从不犯错——人味都在破绽里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI表演不是输在画质，而是输在从不犯错：真人表演的感染力来自节奏、破绽和生命体验，这些目前都还调不出来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI表演</span><span class=\"tag\">演员</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"497 信天翁档案：解密1965年新加坡独立与「新马分家」的台前幕后 信天翁档案 冷藏行动 马来西亚人的马来西亚 马来人至上\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-cn2aa250-新马分家不是被踢出-档案揭李光耀被蒙在鼓里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>新马分家不是被踢出：档案揭李光耀被蒙在鼓里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1965年新马分家，并非新加坡被马来西亚驱逐，而是李光耀的谈判代表吴庆瑞瞒着他主动推动。档案揭开了这段被重构的建国叙事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">新马分家</span><span class=\"tag\">新加坡历史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"雷军急了？一口气发三颗芯片，小米激进造芯到底在赌什么【万字解析】 SLC Hybrid Bonding 近存计算 带宽墙 SMT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-laoshi-小米三芯齐发-激进造芯赌的是垂直整合与时间窗口/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d0667768d416ac24-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"><span class=\"dur\">27:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">老石谈芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>小米三芯齐发：用资源换时间，赌端侧AI范式转变</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小米一口气发布三颗玄界芯片，激进押注存储互联、3D堆叠与全AI架构，用资源换时间，赌端侧AI范式转变和垂直整合能力，但距顶级芯片公司仍有明显差距。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">小米</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Daniel Litt: The Mathematician&#x27;s Guide to AI Lean Mathlib Erdős unit distance problem sum product conjecture resolution of singularities\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-a16z-ai-能证明定理-却还提不出值得问的问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>AI 能证明定理，却还提不出值得问的问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多伦多大学数学家 Daniel Litt 说，模型最擅长把已知技巧用到极致，但数学真正的价值在于理解——而理解目前还留在人脑里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 数学</span><span class=\"tag\">推理能力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"&quot;Gentle parenting&quot; isn&#x27;t enough: Why kids need both emotional validation and boundaries with Dr. Siggie Cohen over parenting balance parenting inhibit an impulse\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-secureattach-孩子打人不是不懂道理-是刹不住冲动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">56:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>孩子打人不是不懂道理，是刹不住冲动</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">父母以为要教孩子「打人不对」，但孩子在平静时早就知道答案。缺的不是知识，是十级情绪下抑制冲动的能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">儿童发展</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Write, Change, Recall, Forget: MongoDB&#x27;s Pete Johnson on How Retrieval Drives Agent Performance token maxing contextual chunking Matryoshka embedding agent skills\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-cogrev-agent-的瓶颈不在上下文-在记忆的写改召回遗忘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f2c0e832077f2ab7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>Agent 瓶颈不在上下文，在记忆的写改召回遗忘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Uber 13 周烧光 token 预算证明塞上下文是错的；MongoDB 把 Agent 性能瓶颈指向记忆——写、改、召回、遗忘，并建议落地从员工用例和人在环开始。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent 记忆</span><span class=\"tag\">向量检索</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Sarah Guo - Funding the Frontier - [Invest Like the Best, EP.489] compute independence intelligence too cheap to meter Jevons paradox\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-ilt-算力的卡点不是技术-是要说服人接受数据中心/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d79369111b5c43ba-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">59:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>算力的卡点不是技术，是要说服人接受数据中心</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一位超大规模云厂商的基础设施负责人告诉她，2030 年前没有能上足够规模的东西。她认为这不是技术、能力或资本主义的问题，而是监管与说服的问题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Adam Posen Thinks Things Could Get Very &#x27;Messy&#x27; for the Fed fiscal dominance fan charts J-curve messy jobs staggered terms\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-oddlots-warsh演讲只是b-嘴上反指引-身体要加息/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">59:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>美联储主席从不输投票：Warsh嘴上反指引，身体已为加息铺路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Posen给Warsh的Jackson Hole演讲打B-，认为他嘴上反对前瞻指引、实际已为加息铺路，并预测未来六个月美联储将加息75-100个基点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美联储</span><span class=\"tag\">通胀</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ep 220 Electroconvulsive Therapy Part 1: A charged history electroconvulsive therapy (ECT) somatic therapy insulin coma therapy Metrosol shock therapy anti-psychiatry movement\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-tpwky-ect-不是酷刑-是精神科最有效的疗法之一/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">50:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>ECT不是酷刑：七成患者缓解，六成痊愈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ECT能让约七成患者缓解、六成患者症状消失；它不是《飞越疯人院》里的电刑，而是从屠宰场到反精神病学运动后仍幸存的最老牌躯体治疗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">精神科</span><span class=\"tag\">ECT</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"287: ENCORE: Best of Ask Lisa: Confidence, Self-Esteem &amp; Self-Compassion relational aggression\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-asklisa-孩子被朋友踢出群-问题不在孩子而在群体/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/316b291cda368a3c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">23:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>孩子被朋友踢出群，问题不在孩子而在群体</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">友谊冲突不是孩子做错了什么，而是群体为了稳固自身把某个成员挤出去——父母能做的是给视角，不是替孩子出头。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亲子</span><span class=\"tag\">青春期</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"179: The Courthouse - Revisited qualified immunity sovereign immunity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-darknetdiaries-持州法院授权测安防-警长却说合同无效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/efb1e077bc2ff15f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Darknet Diaries</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>持州法院授权测安防，警长却说合同无效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">州法院的授权书管不了县法院的大楼，受委托的安全测试因此变成入室盗窃。即使所有指控最终撤销，嫌疑人记录也永远留在案底——司法系统能赔钱，却补不回清白。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">渗透测试</span><span class=\"tag\">物理安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"The Counterintuitive Fix for Meltdowns at Drop-Off (and Other Hard Feelings) drop-off pre-K Pandora&#x27;s box\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-unruffled-孩子越安抚越崩溃-替他说出那些难受才管用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">24:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>孩子越安抚越崩溃：替他说出那些难受才管用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">我们本能地多抱、多亲、转移注意力，想在当下把孩子修好，结果一次都没修好。Janet 的答案是把孩子很可能正在经历的感受替他说出来——哪怕他自己也说不清在难受什么。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情绪命名</span><span class=\"tag\">入园分离</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"手工耿×罗永浩！“村口的五金店里，出现了一个达达主义艺术家” MCN TIG welding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-cn2d7912-手工耿没离开过村子-看他的人却全是城里人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2f52343654f610ee-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:43:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>手工耿没离开过村子，看他的人却全是城里人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的作品需要大空间、不怕造，只有在乡下才做得成；城里人反而觉得不常见。就像唱底层小人物的音乐人，真正买账的是城里人甚至知识分子，他植入的广告受众也全在城里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">短视频</span><span class=\"tag\">内容创作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The most cited paper of the century is a brilliant hack Residual stream Skip connection Register tokens Shattered gradients problem\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-01-welchlabsvideo-残差连接-深度学习史上最被低估的简单-hack/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a540a5f22c57ac52-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">WelchLabsVideo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>残差连接：深度学习史上最被低估的简单 hack</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">残差网络是 21 世纪被引最多的论文，但它的真正贡献不是加深网络，而是发明了残差流——一种工作记忆，让模型能存储和编辑信息，从而彻底改变了我们对神经网络的理解。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">残差网络</span><span class=\"tag\">深度学习</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=