那个说真话的孩子-而是满朝大臣/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda02344d4b647e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">50:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Brain</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>我们不是那个说真话的孩子，而是满朝大臣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">间接语言不是虚伪，而是维护关系的技术。它让双方都能保全面子，但代价是有些话永远说不出口，直到悲剧发生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">语言</span><span class=\"tag\">社交</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Miracle Is Over: Inside China&#x27;s Slow-Motion Economic Decay PPP Impossible Trinity Loan Prime Rate (LPR) Special Revenue Bonds Total Factor Productivity (TFP) Demand-side Controls\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-geopoliticsdec-中国经济巅峰已过-美国优势还将扩大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8de827bd7254104a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">47:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Geopolitics Decanted with Dmitri Alperovitch</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>中国经济巅峰已过：信贷熄火，通缩将至</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国占全球GDP比重2021年见顶后持续下滑，信贷增速从18%降到5%，实际增速或仅1.5%-2%；美国已连续五年跑赢。产业链主导叙事被数据证伪，未来更像日本式通缩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中国经济</span><span class=\"tag\">信贷</span>\n</div></div></a>"]